{"title": "Simplification (Past Year Questions)", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>The value of (x + y)<sup>2</sup> + (x - y)<sup>2</sup> is equal to:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>(x + y)<sup>2</sup> + (x - y)<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;:</p>", "options_en": ["2(x+y)<sup>2</sup>", "2(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)", "(2x+2y)<sup>2</sup>", "4xy"], "options_hi": ["2(x+y)<sup>2</sup>", "2(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)", "(2x+2y)<sup>2</sup>", "4xy"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>We have the equation as :-</p><p>(x + y)<sup>2</sup> + (x - y)<sup>2</sup> </p><p>= x<sup>2 </sup>+ y<sup>2</sup> + 2xy + x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> - 2xy</p><p>= 2(x<sup>2 </sup>+ y<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We have the equation as :-</p><p>(x + y)<sup>2</sup> + (x - y)<sup>2</sup> </p><p>= x<sup>2 </sup>+ y<sup>2</sup> + 2xy + x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> - 2xy</p><p>= 2(x<sup>2 </sup>+ y<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;Simplify:&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">4x<sup>2</sup> - 49y<sup>2</sup></span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">2x + 7y</span></div>&nbsp;+ 7y - 2x&nbsp;</div></p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p><div>&nbsp;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;  :&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">4x<sup>2</sup> - 49y<sup>2</sup></span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">2x + 7y</span></div>&nbsp;+ 7y - 2x&nbsp;</div></p><p></p>", "options_en": ["4x  -  14y", "7y", "4x", "0"], "options_hi": ["4x  -  14y", "7y", "4x", "0"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>We know that 4x<sup>2</sup> - 49y<sup>2</sup> is a difference of squares. It can be factored as:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;4x<sup>2</sup> - 49y<sup>2</sup> = (2x - 7y)(2x + 7y)</p><p>Substitute the factored form into the expression:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;[(2x - 7y)(2x + 7y)] / (2x + 7y) + 7y - 2x</p><p>Cancel the common factor (2x + 7y) in the numerator and denominator (assuming 2x + 7y &#8800; 0):</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;= (2x - 7y) + 7y - 2x</p><p>Combine like terms:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;2x - 2x = 0</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;-7y + 7y = 0</p><p>Thus, the simplified expression is 0.</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We know that 4x<sup>2</sup> - 49y<sup>2</sup> is a difference of squares. It can be factored as:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;4x<sup>2</sup> - 49y<sup>2</sup> = (2x - 7y)(2x + 7y)</p><p>Substitute the factored form into the expression:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;[(2x - 7y)(2x + 7y)] / (2x + 7y) + 7y - 2x</p><p>Cancel the common factor (2x + 7y) in the numerator and denominator (assuming 2x + 7y &#8800; 0):</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;= (2x - 7y) + 7y - 2x</p><p>Combine like terms:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;2x - 2x = 0</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;-7y + 7y = 0</p><p>Thus, the simplified expression is 0.</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify</p><p><div>&nbsp;[3&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">5</span></div>&nbsp;x {2&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inli