;&#2342;&#2367; 56 &div; 4 + p X 3 - 24 &div; 12 + 4 = 21 &div; 3 + 3, &#2340;&#2379; p &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;: </p>", "options_en": ["2", "-1", "1", "-2"], "options_hi": ["2", "-1", "1", "-2"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>56 &div; 4 + p  X  3 - 24 &div; 12 + 4 = 21 &div; 3 + 3</p><p>14 + p  X  3 - 2 + 4 = 7 + 3</p><p>16 + p  X  3 = 10</p><p>p  X  3 = -6</p><p>p = -2</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>56 &div; 4 + p  X  3 - 24 &div; 12 + 4 = 21 &div; 3 + 3</p><p>14 + p  X  3 - 2 + 4 = 7 + 3</p><p>16 + p  X  3 = 10</p><p>p  X  3 = -6</p><p>p = -2</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>The value of 72 &div; 8 - 210 &div; 15 - 5 + 2  X  5 is: </p>", "q_hi": "<p>72 &div; 8 - 210 &div; 15 - 5 + 2 X 5 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;: </p>", "options_en": ["1", "3", "2", "0"], "options_hi": ["1", "3", "2", "0"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>72 &div; 8 - 210 &div; 15 - 5 + 2  X  5</p><p>= 9 - 14 - 5 + 10</p><p>= - 5 + 5</p><p>= 0</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>72 &div; 8 - 210 &div; 15 - 5 + 2  X  5</p><p>= 9 - 14 - 5 + 10</p><p>= - 5 + 5</p><p>= 0</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Evaluate:</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">(232)<sup>3</sup> + (140)<sup>3</sup> + (353)<sup>3</sup> - 3 x 232 x 140 x 353</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">(232)<sup>2</sup> + (140)<sup>2</sup> + (353)<sup>2</sup> - 232 x 140 - 140 x 353  -  353 x 232</span></div></div></p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;  :</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">(232)<sup>3</sup> + (140)<sup>3</sup> + (353)<sup>3</sup> - 3 x 232 x 140 x 353</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">(232)<sup>2</sup> + (140)<sup>2</sup> + (353)<sup>2</sup> - 232 x 140 - 140 x 353  -  353 x 232</span></div></div></p><p></p>", "options_en": ["261", "725", "445", "596"], "options_hi": ["261", "725", "445", "596"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup>  -  3abc = (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  ab  -  bc  -  ca)</p><p>put,</p><p>232 = a, 140 = b, 353 = c in the equation,</p><p>[(232)<sup>3</sup>+(140)<sup>3</sup>+(353)<sup>3</sup> - 3*232*140* 353]/[(232)<sup>2</sup>+(140)<sup>2</sup>+(353)<sup>2</sup> - 232*140 - 140*353  -  353*232]</p><p>=&gt; [(a)<sup>3</sup> + (b)<sup>3</sup> + (c)<sup>3</sup>  -  3abc]/[a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  ab  -  bc  -  ca]</p><p>=&gt; [(a+b+c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  ab  -  bc  -  ca)]/[a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  ab  -  bc  -  ca]</p><p>=&gt; a + b + c</p><p>=&gt; 232 + 140 + 353 = 725</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup>  -  3abc = (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  ab  -  bc  -  ca)</p><p>put,</p><p>232 = a, 140 = b, 353 = c in the equation,</p><p>[(232)<sup>3</sup>+(140)<sup>3</sup>+(353)<sup>3</sup> - 3*232*140* 353]/[(232)<sup>2</sup>+(140)<sup>2</sup>+(353)<sup>2</sup> - 232*140 - 140*353  -  353*232]</p><p>=&gt; [(a)<sup>3</sup> + (b)<sup>3</sup> + (c)<sup>3</sup>  -  3abc]/[a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  ab  -  bc  -  ca]</p><p>=&gt; [(a+b+c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  ab  -  bc  -  ca)]/[a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  ab  -  bc  -  ca]</p><p>=&gt; a + b + c</p><p>=&gt; 232 + 140 + 353 = 725</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify 